WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.333 line:15%
Hey, everybody.

2
00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:03.840 line:15%
Welcome to the brand new rollback format

3
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.240 line:15%
of the Rich Roll podcast,

4
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.990
where we share the best episodes

5
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:12.200
