00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.190
because that will be the only place where I'll be-

170
00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.490
oh, you own it, you own it.

171
00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:24.490
You were the number one Kindle Single for the long run,

172
00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:27.320
atop Stephen King for how long?

