00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:42.010
that would be more than I would've ever hoped for,

178
00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.110
but it was-
Right, get the screen grab.

179
00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.430
I do, I sent,

