197
00:08:35.673 --> 00:08:37.551
No one wants to hear my drunkalog.

198
00:08:37.551 --> 00:08:38.384
Yeah, exactly.

199
00:08:38.384 --> 00:08:41.120
I was just like, "Nobody wants another whiny book

200
00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.850
