201
00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:49.850
And then just doing real hard work to get it back."

202
00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:53.240
And I was wrong.

203
00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.310
People love that stuff, man.

204
00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.340
It's the hero's journey.

205
00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.990
Yeah, and I think, too,

206
00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:01.226
