208
00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:11.030
This is the nation of second chance.

209
00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.620
This is like, we'll give you another shot.

210
00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.253
Historically up till now, we love,

211
