215
00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.180
Well, because it's very human.

216
00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.240
We're all flawed and we all make mistakes,

217
00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:41.070
and I think people can emotionally identify with that.

218
00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:42.643
I have to say, man,

219
00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.970
one of the worst things about me is,

220
00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:50.160
